{"mode":"words","text":"Ak sa učíš zo zoznamov slovíčok, nenaučíš sa jazyk. Na tejto stránke uvidíš naživo, ako sa to za pár sekúnd zmení: Ukážkový text hore je skutočný náhľad aplikácie, s ktorým si môžeš priamo pohrávať, a toto vysvetlenie ti hneď prečíta hlas v kvalite rodného hovoriaceho, zatiaľ čo sa slová rozsvietia. S LinguaFlow sa učíš jazyky tak, ako to má rád tvoj mozog: najprv pochopiť, potom počúvať, potom hovoriť. Metóda, na ktorej je založená, je inšpirovaná Birkenbihlovou metódou a pozostáva zo štyroch krokov: dekódovanie, aktívne počúvanie, pasívne počúvanie a precvičovanie. Vyskúšaj to — klikni hore na slovo.","words":[{"s":0,"e":163},{"s":209,"e":313},{"s":383,"e":650},{"s":685,"e":766},{"s":813,"e":1265},{"s":1300,"e":2020},{"s":2171,"e":2775},{"s":2810,"e":2914},{"s":2984,"e":3495},{"s":4098,"e":4226},{"s":4261,"e":4481},{"s":4528,"e":4969},{"s":5027,"e":5387},{"s":5445,"e":5921},{"s":5968,"e":6177},{"s":6211,"e":6281},{"s":6327,"e":6397},{"s":6455,"e":6560},{"s":6618,"e":6827},{"s":6885,"e":7221},{"s":7245,"e":7814},{"s":8626,"e":9300},{"s":9369,"e":9671},{"s":9741,"e":10043},{"s":10066,"e":10136},{"s":10170,"e":10646},{"s":10716,"e":11064},{"s":11122,"e":12086},{"s":12330,"e":12399},{"s":12423,"e":12713},{"s":12782,"e":12864},{"s":12922,"e":13247},{"s":13317,"e":13607},{"s":13665,"e":14431},{"s":14675,"e":14733},{"s":14791,"e":14988},{"s":15035,"e":15662},{"s":15697,"e":15801},{"s":15824,"e":16045},{"s":16126,"e":16556},{"s":16614,"e":16823},{"s":16858,"e":16904},{"s":16962,"e":17322},{"s":17368,"e":17763},{"s":17798,"e":18750},{"s":19029,"e":19389},{"s":19447,"e":19539},{"s":19586,"e":19667},{"s":19702,"e":19992},{"s":20039,"e":20712},{"s":21409,"e":21467},{"s":21536,"e":22175},{"s":22245,"e":22349},{"s":22419,"e":22697},{"s":22779,"e":23115},{"s":23185,"e":23638},{"s":23847,"e":24067},{"s":24114,"e":24183},{"s":24241,"e":24416},{"s":24450,"e":24590},{"s":24613,"e":24787},{"s":24834,"e":25333},{"s":26029,"e":26401},{"s":26459,"e":26970},{"s":2